n zijn halfbroer, rabbijn Jonathan Levine. Een man is dood aangetroffen in een hotel in Manhattan en diens jonge nichtje is verdwenen. Decker probeert haar te vinden voordat haar iets overkomt. Daarvoor moet hij zijn weg zoeken in een voor hem weinig vertrouwde stad en in kringen waar buitenstaanders niet gemakkelijk toegang krijgen. De zoektocht verbindt familiebanden met verzwegen gebeurtenissen en gevaarlijke contacten buiten de beschermde gemeenschap.","work_id":987147020,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work5036 Stone Kiss / Faye Kellerman; exact Dutch Een stenen omhelzing ISBN 9789022543320 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-029.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p288895827"],"reference":"work:5036","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-029.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL462940W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p288895827"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789022543320","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15100392,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.995Z","editionKey":"/books/OL46979728M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"l