:"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":987334002},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987147036,"language":"nl"},"seq":15,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Rina krijgt bericht dat haar synagoge is beklad met antisemitische leuzen en beelden van nazikampen. Haar man Peter Decker onderzoekt de zaak, die ook hun eigen gezin diep raakt. Een jonge verdachte wordt vervolgd en de gebeurtenis lijkt afgehandeld. Wanneer hij maanden later samen met zijn therapeut wordt vermoord, blijken eerdere vragen toch niet beantwoord. Decker en Rina zoeken naar verbanden tussen de misdrijven, de omgeving van de jongen en geheimen die hun oorsprong in een eerdere generatie hebben.","work_id":987147036,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work5998 The Forgotten / Faye Kellerman; exact Dutch De vergetenen ISBN 9789022541036 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-030.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p27687093X"],"reference":"work:5998","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-030.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL462939W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p27687093X"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789022541036","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15100372,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3