tten hun leefgebied te verliezen. Hun vertrouwde manier van overleven biedt niet genoeg bescherming tegen die verandering. Wolkster moet hulp vragen aan de andere clans en afwachten hoeveel hun onderlinge verbondenheid werkelijk waard is. Deze Warriors-novelle richt zich op een beslissende periode uit de geschiedenis van de HemelClan, met een leider die verantwoordelijkheid voor zijn groep draagt wanneer hun plaats in het woud onzeker wordt.","work_id":987147018,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work5026 Cloudstar''s Journey / Erin Hunter; exact Dutch Wolksters Reis ISBN 9789059245914 paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-032.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p420724907"],"reference":"work:5026","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-032.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL20291907W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p420724907"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789059245914","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15096439,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.997Z","editionKey":"/books/OL42805493M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"n