ewhere."}],"cover_url":null,"edition_id":987247019,"bound_title":"Wolksters Reis","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789059245914","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p420724907","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-048","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":987304010},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987147021,"language":"nl"},"seq":45,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Het is voorjaarsvakantie en Blair trekt bij Serena in. Hun herstelde vriendschap lijkt een goed begin, maar de verhoudingen binnen hun kring blijven veranderlijk. Een gezamenlijke reis naar Sun Valley brengt ook Nate en zijn nieuwe vriendin in dezelfde omgeving. Intussen ontwikkelen de achterblijvers in Manhattan hun eigen liefdes en teleurstellingen. Dit Gossip Girl-deel volgt hoe plannen voor ontspanning opnieuw ruimte maken voor concurrentie, verlangen en vragen over wie werkelijk met wie bevriend is wanneer iedereen door anderen wordt bekeken.","work_id":987147021,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work5046 I like it like that / Cecily von Ziegesar; exact Dutch Ik hou van lekker! ISBN 9789025739973 paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-032.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p278606229"],"reference":"work:5046","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-032.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL5712521W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p278606229"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retai