n. Terwijl zij en Archer aan hun nieuwe rollen wennen, blijken hun verschillen niet het hele verhaal te vertellen. De zorg voor Olive brengt hen dichter bij elkaar dan zij vooraf hadden verwacht.","work_id":987147025,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work5853 The Strawberry Patch Pancake House / Laurie Gilmore; exact Dutch Het Strawberry Patch Pannenkoekenhuis ISBN 9789402717136 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-032.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p444165819"],"reference":"work:5853","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-032.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL44077231W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p444165819"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789402717136","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15126512,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.997Z","editionKey":"/books/OL60291854M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL44077231W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen"