9402717136","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p444165819","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-048","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":987334002},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987147026,"language":"nl"},"seq":51,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Na een neergeslagen mensenopstand proberen overgebleven gemeenschappen een manier van samenleven met de Anderen te vinden. In Lakeside is de vrede betrekkelijk behouden gebleven. Simon Wolfgard en bloedprofetes Meg Corbyn werken er met de menselijke bewoners aan verder herstel. De komst van de problematische broer van luitenant Montgomery zet dat evenwicht echter onder druk. Ook de machtige Ouderen letten op wat één mens binnen een groep kan aanrichten. Meg ziet in haar kaarten dat de oplopende spanning niet zonder gevolgen zal blijven.","work_id":987147026,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work5882 Etched in Bone / Anne Bishop; exact Dutch Witte kaarten ISBN 9789026143533 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-032.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p409176885"],"reference":"work:5882","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-032.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL20048406W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p409176885"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789026143533","status":"no_verifie