age":"nl"},"seq":57,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"In de vroege ochtend vindt rechercheur Peter Decker een klein meisje dat alleen rondloopt en met bloed is besmeurd. Het is niet van haarzelf en niemand in de omgeving meldt zich om haar op te halen. Decker raakt sterk betrokken bij de vraag waar zij vandaan komt en wat haar is overkomen. De weinige aanwijzingen brengen hem naar een veel groter geweldsincident. Terwijl hij ook verlangt naar Rina, die in New York is, probeert hij de veiligheid van het kind te verbinden met een steeds duisterder onderzoek.","work_id":987147029,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work5905 Milk and Honey / Faye Kellerman; exact Dutch Melk en honing ISBN 9789022526149 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-032.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p185295711"],"reference":"work:5905","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-032.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL462934W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p185295711"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789022526149","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15104109,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.997Z","editionKey":"/books/OL42944993M","limitation":"