t zij de wezens in de menagerie. Daarnaast zoekt ze naar haar verdwenen tweelingbroer, die volgens anderen door een draak is verslonden. Autumn denkt hem nog te horen in het kasteel, maar weinig mensen nemen haar serieus. Wanneer de uitverkoren leerling Cai haar hulp nodig heeft, stelt ze een voorwaarde: samen moeten zij naar haar broer zoeken. Hun afspraak brengt ook de geheimen van de school dichterbij.","work_id":987147042,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work6056 The School Between Winter and Fairyland / Heather Fawcett; exact Dutch De school op de rand van Sageland ISBN 9789026158872 HArdcover. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-033.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p435365991"],"reference":"work:6056","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-033.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL24405610W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p435365991"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789026158872","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15174447,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.998Z","editionKey":"/books/OL61374889M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"languag