e voelt zich er al snel thuis, totdat ze ontdekt dat er op zeldzame ijsdraken wordt gejaagd voor hun schubben. Ember besluit aan die jacht mee te doen om haar van binnenuit tegen te werken. Daarbij moet zij voorkomen dat de jagers ontdekken wie zij werkelijk is.","work_id":987147045,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work6063 Ember and the Ice Dragons / Heather Fawcett; exact Dutch Ember en de ijsdraken ISBN 9789026151200 Hardcover. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-033.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p424472856"],"reference":"work:6063","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-033.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL20438910W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p424472856"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789026151200","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15174443,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.999Z","editionKey":"/books/OL61374888M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL20438910W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993+00:00","source_name"