_id":987147049,"language":"nl"},"seq":91,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Eniiyi wordt geboren op de dag dat de familie haar nicht Monife begraaft. Haar gelijkenis met de overledene voedt de overtuiging dat zij hetzelfde leven zal herhalen. Ook een vermeende vloek op de vrouwen van de familie bepaalt hun verwachtingen over liefde en verlating. Wanneer Eniiyi zelf verliefd wordt, probeert zij te begrijpen hoeveel van die erfenis haar toekomst werkelijk vastlegt. De roman verbindt verschillende generaties vrouwen in Lagos en onderzoekt hoe familieverhalen bescherming kunnen beloven, maar ook vrijheid kunnen beperken.","work_id":987147049,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work6155 Cursed Daughters / Oyinkan Braithwaite; exact Dutch Vervloekte dochters ISBN 9789493420359 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-033.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p453922430"],"reference":"work:6155","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-033.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL44216500W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p453922430"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789493420359","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15130374,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":