iemand wordt vermoord en er daarna meer slachtoffers vallen, verandert de bijeenkomst in een gevecht om te ontsnappen. Haar uitgebreide kennis van horror- en romantische films biedt onverwacht houvast. De dader lijkt bovendien zelf een bepaald verhaal te willen maken van de overgebleven daters. Jamie moet proberen de regels van dat spel te doorzien, terwijl toenadering tot andere overlevenden haar aandacht eveneens opeist.","work_id":987147055,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work6230 How to Kill a Guy in Ten Dates / Shailee Thompson; exact Dutch Zo vermoord je een man in tien dates ISBN 9789020558869 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-034.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p455960208"],"reference":"work:6230","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-034.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL45051977W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p455960208"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789020558869","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15202594,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:37.000Z","editionKey":"/books/OL61454227M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere