t-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789026367861","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15135889,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:37.001Z","editionKey":"/books/OL60528349M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"cover_url":null,"edition_id":987247011,"bound_title":"Neem ruim zei de zee","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789026367861","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p44205114X","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-048","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":987347005},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987147011,"language":"nl"},"seq":119,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Noor mist haar plotseling overleden vader. Wanneer zij merkt dat ze soms een paar uur niet aan hem heeft gedacht, wordt ze bang hem te vergeten. Dan verschijnt Vedder bij haar slaapkamerraam en neemt haar een nacht mee op zijn motor. Hun tocht geeft haar de gelegenheid anders naar de herinneringen en het verlies te kijken. Buddy Tegenbosch volgt twee jongeren die elkaar vinden op een moment waarop gewone woorden niet genoeg lijken. De nacht wordt een poging plaats te maken voor verdriet zonder de band met haar vader kwijt te raken.","work_id":987147011,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work2364 Mijn nacht met Vedder / Buddy Tegenbosch; exact Dutch Mijn nacht met Vedder ISBN 9789000376650 Hardcover. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-035.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p432266895"],"reference":"work:2364","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-035.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL44651244W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p432266895"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789000376650","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15153965,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:37.001Z","editionKey":"/books/OL60989285M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL44651244W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-048","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987347007},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987247012},"seq":120,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":987147011,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work2364 Mijn nacht met Vedder / Buddy Tegenbosch; exact Dutch Mijn nacht met Vedder ISBN 9789000376650 Hardcover. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-035.json. No new Work, changed firs